{"id":"F494","verdict":"accept","strength":"weak","label":"1A","direction":"against","note":"These are service-plan dollars, not consumables, and the amounts are immaterial. The renewal price is still worth noting: C$20,420.62 (Jul 2024) to C$23,894.87 (Jan 2026) is +17% in about 18 months, or roughly +11%/yr, after MiSeq end of sale. So a legacy platform can carry price increases on service, but this says nothing about 6000 consumables volume."},
